SUMMARY:Media Career Day 2026
DESCRIPTION:Dozens of Media School alumni are returning to Franklin Hall 
 on Friday\, November 6 for Media Career Day\, a day of career conversatio
 ns and networking. The conference features panels and roundtables\, one-o
 n-one career chats\, and a networking breakfast and lunch with featured s
 peakers. Take this opportunity to learn from industry professionals\, exp
 and your network\, and connect with alumni who were once in your shoes.&#
 160\;Event Schedule (https://mediaschool.indiana.edu/news-events/events/c
 areer-day/index.html)  Interested in having a one-on-one conversation wit
 h one of our Media School alumni? Sign up here (https://www.signupgenius.
 com/go/mcdcareerchat2026#/)  This event is Momentum eligible.
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  Dozens of Media School alumni are retur
 ning to Franklin Hall on Friday\, November 6 for Media Career Day\, a day
  of career conversations and networking. The conference features panels a
 nd roundtables\, one-on-one career chats\, and a networking breakfast and
  lunch with featured speakers. Take this opportunity to learn from indust
 ry professionals\, expand your network\, and connect with alumni who were
  once in your shoes.&#160\;</p><p><strong><a href="https://mediaschool.in
 diana.edu/news-events/events/career-day/index.html">Event Schedule</a></s
 trong></p><p>  Interested in having a one-on-one conversation with one of
  our Media School alumni? <a href="https://www.signupgenius.com/go/mcdcar
 eerchat2026#/">Sign up here</a></p><p><br />  This event is Momentum elig
 ible.</p>
