LOCATION:IU CINEMA
GEO:39.168613;-86.517376
SUMMARY:No No Nooky T.V. + Nitrate Kisses | Underground Film Series
DESCRIPTION:No No Nooky T.V.(1987):No No Nooky T.V. confronts the feminis
 t controversy around sexuality with electronic language\, pixels\, and in
 terface. Even the monitor is eroticized in this film/video hybrid that po
 ints fun at romance\, sexuality\, and love in our post-industrial age. [1
 2 min\; experimental\; English]Nitrate Kisses(1992): Barbara Hammer's doc
 umentary Nitrate Kisses confronts the historical erasure of queer sexuali
 ty through the frank embrace of sex as an act that is both liberating and
  political. [67 min\; English]
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p><i><strong>No No Nooky T.V.</strong></i><
 strong>(1987):</strong><i>No No Nooky T.V.</i> confronts the feminist con
 troversy around sexuality with electronic language\, pixels\, and interfa
 ce. Even the monitor is eroticized in this film/video hybrid that points 
 fun at romance\, sexuality\, and love in our post-industrial age. [12 min
 \; experimental\; English]</p><p><i><strong>Nitrate Kisses</strong></i><s
 trong>(1992):</strong> Barbara Hammer's documentary <i>Nitrate Kisses</i>
  confronts the historical erasure of queer sexuality through the frank em
 brace of sex as an act that is both liberating and political. [67 min\; E
 nglish]</p>
