SUMMARY:What's Happening to Climate Journalism?
DESCRIPTION:This panel will examine the dynamics that influence news atte
 ntion to climate change and consider the challenges of reporting the beat
  in a contested political and economic environment for climate journalism
 .  Panelists:Karl Schneider\, Indy Star environment reporter  Suzannah Ev
 ans Comfort\, associate professor\, the Media School  Ryan Comfort\, assi
 stant professor\, the Media School    Moderated by Gerry Lanosga of The M
 edia School
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  This panel will examine the dynamics th
 at influence news attention to climate change and consider the challenges
  of reporting the beat in a contested political and economic environment 
 for climate journalism.<br /><br />  Panelists:</p><ul><li>Karl Schneider
 \, Indy Star environment reporter  </li><li>Suzannah Evans Comfort\, asso
 ciate professor\, the Media School  </li><li>Ryan Comfort\, assistant pro
 fessor\, the Media School  </li></ul><p>  Moderated by Gerry Lanosga of T
 he Media School</p>
