 E CENTER
GEO:39.172501;-86.517667
SUMMARY:Pathways in Sustainability: Sophie Hartley
DESCRIPTION:Sponsored by the O'Neill Career Hub\, the Walter Center for C
 areer Achievement\, the Media School\, and ESSI.In our second installment
  of Pathways in Sustainability\, join us to hear a presentation from Soph
 ie Hartley about her career path\, her experience as an environmental rep
 orter in Indiana\, and her advice for students interested in similar care
 er paths. After the presentation\, the floor will be open for a Q&amp\;A 
 and discussion with Sophie.  Pizza &amp\; refreshments will be provided! 
  In collaboration with the IU Walter Center for Career Achievement and th
 e O'Neill Career Hub\, the Environment\, Society\, and Sustainability Ins
 titute (ESSI) is hosting employers and practitioners for a series of care
 er presentations and discussions with students. Taking place right here o
 n the Bloomington campus\, this new series of career visits is called Pat
 hways in Sustainability. This series is meant to help introduce you to th
 e diversity of career paths available to you as a student majoring in an 
 environmental area (or as a student with environmental interests!).&#160\
 ;
