  the Walter Center for Career Achievement\, the Media School\, and ESSI.<
 /em></p><p><strong>In our second installment of Pathways in Sustainabilit
 y\, join us to hear a presentation from Sophie Hartley about her career p
 ath\, her experience as an environmental reporter in Indiana\, and her ad
 vice for students interested in similar career paths. After the presentat
 ion\, the floor will be open for a Q&amp\;A and discussion with Sophie.</
 strong></p><p>  Pizza &amp\; refreshments will be provided!</p><p>  In co
 llaboration with the IU Walter Center for Career Achievement and the O'Ne
 ill Career Hub\, the Environment\, Society\, and Sustainability Institute
  (ESSI) is hosting employers and practitioners for a series of career pre
 sentations and discussions with students. Taking place right here on the 
 Bloomington campus\, this new series of career visits is called <em>Pathw
 ays in Sustainability</em>. This series is meant to help introduce you to
  the diversity of career paths available to you as a student majoring in 
 an environmental area (or as a student with environmental interests!).&#1
 60\;</p>
